  "description": "RECPOH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H88 N8 O21 Sm6,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm5 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm6 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.423-4.713 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.55-159.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Sm6C70H94N8O23. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
